r%2CoperandError%2CreturnError%29%7B%0A%20if%28operandOwner%21%3D%3DreturnOwner%29return%20false%3B%0A%20if%28operandOwner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aoption%3A%3AOption%27%29return%20operandError%3D%3D%3D%27%27%26%26returnError%3D%3D%3D%27%27%3B%0A%20return%20operandOwner%3D%3D%3D%27std%3A%3Aresult%3A%3AResult%27%26%26operandError%21%3D%3D%27%27%26%26operandError%3D%3D%3DreturnError%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Owning%20operands%20require%20actual%20direct%20ownership%2C%20independently%20from%20Copy.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20operandOwner%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20returnOwner%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20ordinary%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20role%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20wrappers%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20operandError%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20returnError%20%40returns%20%7Bboolean%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20acceptRustStandardSumOwnedQuestionContext%28operandOwner%2CreturnOwner%2Cordinary%2Crole%2Cwrappers%2CoperandError%2CreturnError%29%7Breturn%20ordinary%26%26role%3D%3D%3D%27owned%27%26%26wrappers%3D%3D%3D0%26%26acceptRustStandardSumQuestionFamily%28operandOwner%2CreturnOwner%2CoperandError%2CreturnError%29%3B%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Independent%20conversion%20profile.%20Primitive%20certificates%20come%20from%20actual%0A%20%2A%20complete%20source%20types%20and%20canonical%20structural%20identities%2C%20not%20width%20guesses.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20operandOwner%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20returnOwner%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20ordinary%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20role%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20wrappers%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20directCopy%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20sourceKnown%20%40param%20%7Bboolean%7D%20targetKnown%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20source%20%40param%20%7Bstring%7D%20target%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%7D%20minor%0A%20%2A%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustStandardSumPrimitiveQuestionConversionPlan%28operandOwner%2CreturnOwner%2Cordinary%2Crole%2Cw